            "html": "<article id=\"post-27671\" class=\"post-27671 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-citacoes tag-coronavirus tag-lewandowski tag-manaus tag-politica tag-stf\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#citacoes\" rel=\"category\">Citações</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2021-01-16-lewandowski-manda-governo-federal-agir-imediatamente-para-sanar-colapso-em-manaus.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">Lewandowski manda governo federal agir “imediatamente” para sanar colapso em Manaus</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2021-01-16-lewandowski-manda-governo-federal-agir-imediatamente-para-sanar-colapso-em-manaus.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2021-01-16T00:07:49-03:00\">16/01/2021</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2021-01-16-lewandowski-manda-governo-federal-agir-imediatamente-para-sanar-colapso-em-manaus.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#coronavirus\" rel=\"tag\">Coronavirus</a> <a href=\"tag.html#lewandowski\" rel=\"tag\">Lewandowski</a> <a href=\"tag.html#manaus\" rel=\"tag\">Manaus</a> <a href=\"tag.html#politica\" rel=\"tag\">Política</a> <a href=\"tag.html#stf\" rel=\"tag\">STF</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<blockquote>\n<h2><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-27680 size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\" src=\"https://estranhosidade.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/o-ministro-ricardo-lewandowski-durante-sessao-da-2-turma-do-stf-supremo-tribunal-federal-1602291981943_v2_1920x1211.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"299\" /><br /><a style=\"outline-width:0 !important;\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210116024758/https://congressoemfoco.uol.com.br/justica/lewandowski-governo-federal-imediatamente-manaus/\">&#8220;Lewandowski manda governo federal agir “imediatamente” para sanar colapso em Manaus&#8221;</a></h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Infelizmente, as únicas decisões do STF que se realizam na prática são aquelas <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20201117134808/https://www.poder360.com.br/justica/marco-aurelio-manda-soltar-andre-do-rap-lider-do-pcc-em-sao-paulo/\">soltando bandidos, traficantes e assassinos, e ajudando a desacreditar a justiça de maneira geral</a>. Se depender de decisões do Supremo, Manaus e todo o Brasil morreram asfixiados.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></article>",
